---
---

<section class="architecture-section section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="arch-container glass-card">
      <div class="arch-content">
        <h2 class="arch-title">Arquitectura Tecnológica Embebida</h2>
        <p class="arch-description">
          Lúa no es un simple juguete; es una pieza de ingeniería electrónica diseñada para responder con latencia mínima y cumplir con los más altos estándares de desarrollo IoT.
        </p>
        
        <div class="tech-specs">
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Procesamiento (Core)</span>
            <strong class="spec-value">ESP32-C3 / ESP32-S3</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Visualización Facial</span>
            <strong class="spec-value">IPS Circular (GC9A01) a 60 FPS</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Firmware Base</span>
            <strong class="spec-value">C++ (ESP-IDF) + FreeRTOS</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Comunicaciones</span>
            <strong class="spec-value">BLE 5.0 (GATT Server)</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Gestión de Audio Local</span>
            <strong class="spec-value">Códec I2S (ES8311)</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <span class="spec-label">Orquestador Móvil</span>
            <strong class="spec-value">Módulo nativo React Native (ble-plx)</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="arch-visual">
        <!-- Visual abstracto del microcontrolador -->
        <div class="microcontroller">
          <div class="chip-body">
            <span class="chip-brand">Espressif</span>
            <span class="chip-model">ESP32-C3</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pins left">
            <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
          </div>
          <div class="pins right">
            <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .architecture-section {
    padding: 60px 0 100px 0;
  }

  .arch-container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4rem;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 4rem;
  }

  .arch-content {
    flex: 1.5;
  }

  .arch-title {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .arch-description {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .tech-specs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .spec-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .spec-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #f97316;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .spec-value {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .arch-visual {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .microcontroller {
    position: relative;
    width: 140px;
    height: 140px;
  }

  .chip-body {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 20px;
    right: 20px;
    bottom: 0;
    background: #1e293b;
    border: 2px solid #334155;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    z-index: 2;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }

  .chip-brand {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .chip-model {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: white;
    font-family: monospace;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .pins {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    bottom: 10px;
    width: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .pins.left {
    left: 0;
  }

  .pins.right {
    right: 0;
  }

  .pins i {
    width: 100%;
    height: 6px;
    background: #cbd5e1;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .arch-container {
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
